                <pb facs="0583" n="511" sameAs="frus:frus1882/pg511"/>

                <p>Article third of the regulation of 13th (25th) October, 1873, published in the
                    Impartial of 27th October, 1873:</p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Article</hi> 3.—All petroleum
                    contained in the vessel shall be deposited in a special store-house to the
                    choice of the importer, provided that this store-house should be two kilometers
                    distant at least from the town and one kilometer at least from the villages.</p>
            </div>
